<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="554245890"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1363759916"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Lemonade"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Mili"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Millennium Mother"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:10.547"><div begin="00:16.765" end="03:08.068"><p begin="00:16.765" end="00:24.185" itunes:key="L1">Sparkling leftover lemonade you'll never touch<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">喝剩的柠檬水闪闪发亮 不再被你触碰</span></p><p begin="00:25.265" end="00:30.645" itunes:key="L2">Tripped over my knock-off Littala cup<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">伊塔拉玻璃杯的仿冒品把我绊倒</span></p><p begin="00:31.715" end="00:32.805" itunes:key="L3">Lemonade<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">柠檬水</span></p><p begin="00:33.057" end="00:35.001" itunes:key="L4">It spills all over<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就这样洒出</span></p><p begin="00:35.240" end="00:36.540" itunes:key="L5">(Over and over)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洒出 洒出</span></p><p begin="00:36.541" end="00:37.141" itunes:key="L6">Over<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洒出</span></p><p begin="00:37.362" end="00:38.592" itunes:key="L7">(Over and over)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洒出 洒出</span></p><p begin="00:38.679" end="00:39.289" itunes:key="L8">Over<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洒出</span></p><p begin="00:39.478" end="00:42.468" itunes:key="L9">No matter how much I clean it up<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论我怎样清洗</span></p><p begin="00:42.963" end="00:43.583" itunes:key="L10">Over<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洒出</span></p><p begin="00:43.775" end="00:45.045" itunes:key="L11">(Over and over)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洒出 洒出</span></p><p begin="00:45.093" end="00:45.803" itunes:key="L12">Over<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洒出</span></p><p begin="00:45.920" end="00:47.270" itunes:key="L13">(Over and over)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洒出 洒出</span></p><p begin="00:47.273" end="00:47.953" itunes:key="L14">Over<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洒出</span></p><p begin="00:48.051" end="00:50.961" itunes:key="L15">Lemonade sinks into the floor<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">柠檬水渗入地板</span></p><p begin="00:51.534" end="00:52.234" itunes:key="L16">Over<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洒出</span></p><p begin="00:52.311" end="00:53.631" itunes:key="L17">(Over and over)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洒出 洒出</span></p><p begin="00:53.674" end="00:54.294" itunes:key="L18">Over<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洒出</span></p><p begin="00:54.485" end="00:55.805" itunes:key="L19">(Over and over)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洒出 洒出</span></p><p begin="00:55.840" end="00:56.460" itunes:key="L20">Over<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洒出</span></p><p begin="00:56.591" end="00:59.651" itunes:key="L21">No matter how much I lick it off<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论我怎样舔舐</span></p><p begin="01:00.121" end="01:02.201" itunes:key="L22">Over, over and over<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洒出</span></p><p begin="01:02.275" end="01:04.355" itunes:key="L23">Over, over and over<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洒出</span></p><p begin="01:04.391" end="01:08.234" itunes:key="L24">Over and over and over and over<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洒出 洒出 洒出 洒出</span></p><p begin="01:08.395" end="01:15.535" itunes:key="L25">You said I make the best lemonade in the world<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你说我调的柠檬水最好喝</span></p><p begin="01:16.695" end="01:24.085" itunes:key="L26">A little bitter, a little sweet, a little sour<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有一点苦 有一点甜 还有一点酸</span></p><p begin="01:25.285" end="01:32.575" itunes:key="L27">Now that you're gone, so much lemonade gets left over<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">自从你走了 好多柠檬水都被剩下了</span></p><p begin="01:33.108" end="01:34.698" itunes:key="L28">Waiting to be drank<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">等待着谁来把它喝掉 好希望那个人是你</span></p><p begin="01:35.230" end="01:39.150" itunes:key="L29">I wish that person could be you</p><p begin="01:40.270" end="01:41.370" itunes:key="L30">Lemonade<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">柠檬水</span></p><p begin="01:41.616" end="01:42.726" itunes:key="L31">It spills all<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就这样洒出</span></p><p begin="01:42.932" end="01:43.532" itunes:key="L32">(Over)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洒出 洒出</span></p><p begin="01:43.757" end="01:45.047" itunes:key="L33">Over and over<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">溢出 （流动不停）</span></p><p begin="01:45.112" end="01:45.622" itunes:key="L34">(Over)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洒出</span></p><p begin="01:45.944" end="01:47.233" itunes:key="L35">Over and over<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洒出 洒出</span></p><p begin="01:47.242" end="01:47.712" itunes:key="L36">(Over)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洒出</span></p><p begin="01:48.077" end="01:51.027" itunes:key="L37">No matter how much I want you back<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论我有多想要你回来</span></p><p begin="01:51.552" end="01:52.082" itunes:key="L38">(Over)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洒出</span></p><p begin="01:52.367" end="01:53.577" itunes:key="L39">Over and over<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洒出 洒出</span></p><p begin="01:53.662" end="01:54.062" itunes:key="L40">(Over)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洒出</span></p><p begin="01:54.481" end="01:55.801" itunes:key="L41">Over and over<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洒出 洒出</span></p><p begin="01:55.802" end="01:56.392" itunes:key="L42">(Over)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洒出</span></p><p begin="01:56.602" end="01:59.552" itunes:key="L43">Lemonade stains my pillowcase<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">柠檬水染色我的枕套</span></p><p begin="02:00.102" end="02:00.722" itunes:key="L44">(Over)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洒出</span></p><p begin="02:00.902" end="02:02.162" itunes:key="L45">Over and over<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洒出 洒出</span></p><p begin="02:02.252" end="02:02.772" itunes:key="L46">(Over)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洒出</span></p><p begin="02:03.037" end="02:04.367" itunes:key="L47">Over and over<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洒出 洒出</span></p><p begin="02:04.382" end="02:04.942" itunes:key="L48">(Over)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洒出</span></p><p begin="02:05.225" end="02:08.225" itunes:key="L49">No matter how much I wipe it off<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论我怎样擦拭</span></p><p begin="02:08.672" end="02:10.792" itunes:key="L50">Over, over and over<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洒出</span></p><p begin="02:10.805" end="02:12.915" itunes:key="L51">Over, over and over<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洒出</span></p><p begin="02:12.962" end="02:16.802" itunes:key="L52">Over and over and over and over<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洒出 洒出 洒出 洒出</span></p><p begin="02:17.275" end="02:17.920" itunes:key="L53">Over<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洒出</span></p><p begin="02:20.950" end="02:22.150" itunes:key="L54">And over<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洒出</span></p><p begin="02:23.653" end="02:26.463" itunes:key="L55">Over and over<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不停地洒出</span></p><p begin="02:29.533" end="02:30.703" itunes:key="L56">And over<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洒出</span></p><p begin="02:31.943" end="02:32.893" itunes:key="L57">And over<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洒出</span></p><p begin="02:33.792" end="02:41.332" itunes:key="L58">Sparkling leftover lemonade you'll never touch<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">喝剩的柠檬水闪闪发亮 不再被你触碰</span></p><p begin="02:42.362" end="02:47.812" itunes:key="L59">Tripped over my knock-off Littala cup<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">伊塔拉玻璃杯的仿冒品把我绊倒</span></p><p begin="02:48.855" end="02:49.985" itunes:key="L60">Lemonade<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">柠檬水</span></p><p begin="02:50.208" end="02:54.498" itunes:key="L61">It spills over<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就这样洒出</span></p><p begin="02:55.278" end="02:58.928" itunes:key="L62">And over<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洒出</span></p><p begin="02:59.548" end="03:03.298" itunes:key="L63">Over<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好多好多</span></p><p begin="03:03.828" end="03:08.068" itunes:key="L64">And over<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">又洒出来了</span></p></div></body></tt>